{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["שאו את ראש כל עדת — For from now on they must come to the land of Israel, and those twenty years old are fit to go out to the army of war, since on the twentieth of this second month the cloud set out, as written in the perasha of BeHa'alotekha, and it is written there: נוסעים אנחנו אל המקום וגו׳. Therefore the Holy One, blessed be He, commanded at the beginning of this month to count them."], :book :numbers, :voice :rashbam, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T14:49:41.041512106Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}